         measured: m_H^2 - m_L^2 = 2*epsilon; Z2xZ2 {'lam|Phi|^4': True, 'lam(ImPhi^2)^2': True}; vertices {'lam|Phi|^4': lambda/2, 'lam(ImPhi^2)^2': lambda}; kick reproduced at 575-650: True

